{{c|{{smaller|Balance-reef.}}}}
{{c|{{smaller|''a'', sail before reefing; ''b'', balance-reefed sail.}}}}
is generally placed in all gaff-sails, the band running from the throat to the clew. Either the upper or the lower half of the sail may be reefed.

